    "channel": 1,
    "ratio": 0.05,
    "fixedBeforeTheRun": true,
    "note": "Fixed in `e2e/contrast-probe.ts` before this run. The previous calibration was a 5.2-5.7 BAND wide enough to contain navy-900 (5.45), navy-950 (5.57) and the 5.65 the broken parser produced from a pure-black backdrop -- so it could not detect the bug."
  },
  "probeFix": "`numbers()` read alpha only from a slash component, so legacy `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)` -- what `getComputedStyle().backgroundColor` returns for a transparent background -- parsed as OPAQUE BLACK and `effectiveBg` stopped at the first transparent ancestor. Every figure Commits 3 and 4 recorded was inflated. Fixed in Commit 4a.",
